# Au(111) + SPC-FQ film dynamics, arm nometal (run_dyn_spc.py)
units           metal
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
fix             pb all property/atom i_body ghost yes
read_data       data fix pb NULL RigidBodies
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (17.650658 20.381224 14.97)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  528 atoms
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     0 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     1 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.003 seconds
group           water type 2 3
528 atoms in group water
group           fq    type 2 3
528 atoms in group fq
pair_style      hybrid/overlay lj/cut 12.0 coul/long 12.0 coul/shield/intra 12.0 all cbrt
pair_coeff      * * lj/cut 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      2 2 lj/cut 0.01275 3.144
pair_coeff      1 2 lj/cut 0.05 3.0            # illustrative Au-O term (not a fitted gold-water potential)
pair_coeff      * * coul/long
pair_coeff      1 1 coul/shield/intra 0.2372
pair_coeff      2 2 coul/shield/intra 1.11
pair_coeff      3 3 coul/shield/intra 1.11
kspace_style    pppm/samqeq 1.0e-6
kspace_modify   gewald 0.35 mesh 24 28 20   # pinned: all-zero start charges make the automatic mesh far too coarse
Updated KSpace settings:
  KSpace computation is turned:    ON
  Use MPI collective operations:   OFF
  Use MPI non-blocking operations: OFF
  Gewald manually set to:          0.35
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

# per-molecule constraints
fix             chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 12.0 1.0e-7 param
fix_modify      chg shield cbrt
samqeq: lr-solve shielding = cbrt J_shield (param 4th col = gamma); routed through compute_H + add_fixed_charge_field + the legacy gas path (calc_Hval)
fix_modify      chg energy yes

velocity        water create 298.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             rig water rigid/nvt/small custom i_body temp 298.0 298.0 0.02
Fix rigid/nvt/small setup ...
  create bodies CPU = 0.000 seconds
  176 rigid bodies with 528 atoms
  1.0000026 = max distance from body owner to body atom
compute         kew water ke
variable        Tw equal c_kew*2.0/((6*176-3)*8.617333e-5)
variable        aq atom abs(q)
compute         qmax fq reduce max v_aq
thermo_style    custom step v_Tw pe c_qmax
thermo          100
timestep        0.00025
run             2000            # gentle start from the grid (tight coupling, 0.25 fs)

